�Mia sunarpastike istoria musteriou kai tautokhrona monadike perigraphe tes periodou pou e Kina aphene to khthes kai pernouse sto semera, se ena apo ta pente kalutera politika muthistoremata olon ton epokhon.
Stis 11 MaIou tou 1990, sta nera enos apomerou kanaliou, kapou eikosi milia dutika tes Sangkaes, duo erasitekhnes psarades briskoun nekre mesa se sako mia nea gunaika. Eidopoioun ton ntetektib tes astunomias Giou, katathetoun sto Tmema kai khanoun to psarema kai te mera tous* ostoso kanenas den phtaiei gia o,ti egine, aphou opos leei o arkhaios kinezos sophos <>. Etsi arkhizei O thanatos tes Kokkines Eroidas tou Kiou Ksiaolongk (Sangkae, 1953), to proto mias seiras muthistorematon me eroa ton epitheorete Tsen, to opoio ekdotheke to 2000. O suggrapheas, pou askholetheke me te metaphrase poietikon ergon kai te logotekhnike kritike, to 1988 episkephtheke tis EPA me upotrophia tou Idrumatos Phornt- gia na grapsei melete gia ton T. S. Eliot-, kai meta ta gegonota tou kalokairiou tou 1989 sten plateia Tiananmen apophasise na men epistrepsei sten patrida tou. Emeine sten Amerike, opou semera didaskei Kinezike Logotekhnia se topiko panepistemio.
E upothese tes nekres gunaikas pou analambanei o Tsen peripleketai otan ginetai gnoste e tautoteta tes: prokeitai gia ten Gkouan, Kokkine Eroida, brabeumene apo to Kommounistiko Komma tes Kinas os Prote Ergazomene tes khoras. O Tsen pou ekhei spoudasei agglike philologia kai logo tes enaskholeses tou me ten poiese einai melos tes Ethnikes Enoses Suggrapheon (isos den prepei na mas phainetai allokote e uparxe sten Kina enos mpatsou-poiete, aphou to idio allokote ekei einai kai e sunuparxe kommounismou- kapitalismou) krubei ena sunaisthematiko trauma. Ostoso sunergazetai me ton ntetektib Giou kai mazi, kontra sta empodia pou tou thetoun kommatika stelekhe, prospathoun na exikhniasoun to egklema sto opoio einai anamemeigmenos o Bou, gios geraiou axiomatoukhou tou kommatos. E ploke den einai arketa prototupe, ostoso o suggrapheas den skopeuei na mas phortosei me ena ptoma, sumphona me ten klasike rese tou Reimont Tsantler, alla epithumei na thixei pragmata pou ton kaine. Na milesei delade gia politike. Anatrekhei loipon sten istoria tes Kinas apo ton Mao (1893-1976) eos ton Ntengk Khsiao Pingk (1904-1997), apo te legomene Politistike Epanastase kai ton diogmo ton dianooumenon mekhri te metakinese eparkhioton stis poleis gia na broun opoiadepote ergasia. Ta pragmata den einai katholou, ma katholou, eidulliaka ste sugkhrone Kina. O anagnostes, metaxu allon, plerophoreitai pos o kentrikos eroas, o Tsen, an kai axiomatikos tes astunomias, diabioi polu lita, exaitias ton khamelon apolabon tou. E katoikia tou einai mikre, khoris zesto nero, metakineitai me leophoreio (o ntetektib Giou, molonoti eggamos, zei se ena domatio-krebatokamara, saloni, trapezaria kai mpanio me te gunaika kai to paidi tou). Auta os pros ten koinonike katastase. Os pros ten anaptuxe ton kharakteron o suggrapheas plathei eroes, andres kai gunaikes, apo tous opoious orismenoi einai adistaktoi aphou khresimopoioun kathe dunato meso, ten politike, ten ideologia, to soma tous gia na kanoun kariera, na ploutisoun. E Gkouan, e Kokkine Eroida, anekei se auten kategoria, se antithese me ton epitheorete Tsen, o opoios graphontas poiese e apostethizontas poiemata allon, kathos kai apophthegmata tou Komphoukiou, me ta khronia ginetai sophoteros. Auton ton philosophounta astunomiko ton apaskholoun o khronos kai oi allages pou epipherei stous anthropous. Psilopragmata, bebaia. Dioti, o khronos, diabazoume, sumphona me ton Bouda, <>."�
�Agries kai paradoxes erotikes istories apo ton "poiete tes amerikanikes khamozoes".
E kathemerinoteta enos tsakismenou anthropou -poto, gunaikes, apokleroi kai biaioteta- grammene me trupheroteta, kunismo kai khioumor.
To ergo tou Mpoukophski, se megalo Bathmo autobiographiko, perilambanei perissotera apo 45 Biblia: poiese, diegemata kai muthistoremata. Polla erga tou ekhoun metapherthei ston kinematographo. Ektos apo ta prosopiko tou biomata, sta erga tou Mpoukophski antikatoptrizetai e perithoriake, anarkhike pleura tes amerikanikes pragmatikotetas, ten opoia, mekhri prosphata, e amerikanike logotekhnia eite katadikaze eite, ethelemena, agnoouse. Antitheta, to europaiko koino tou epiphulaxe, apo ten prote stigme pou ton gnorise, entuposiaka therme upodokhe. To ergo tou ekhei metaphrastei se perissoteres apo dodeka glosses. Par' ola auta, megalo meros paremene anekdoto mekhri prosphata."�
�"To solo tou Phigkaro" einai, endekhomenos, to pio protoporiako kai tolmero muthistorema tes Genias tou Trianta kai tes epokhes tou suggraphea. Parallela, apotelei to pio semantiko ergo tes pezographikes paragoges tou Skarimpa, dioti s' auto apantoun ta idiaitera kharakteristika tou prosopikou tou uphous, sten pio drastike tous ekdokhe.
To muthistorema ekdotheke pros to telos mias polu gonimes dekaetias, to 1939, opote e ananeose tou poietikou pezou logou ekhei skhedon suntelestei: e Genia tou Trianta ekhei kanei ten emphanise tes me merika apo ta drastikotera erga tes, kai o esoterikos monologos kai o uperrealismos ekhoun dosei semantika deigmata graphes.
E kritike antimetopise to muthistorema tou Skarimpa -me elakhistes exaireseis- arnetika, adunatontas na apophanthei an to ergo einai ontos muthistorema, kai an o suggrapheas satirizei ton uperrealismo e graphei uperrealistiko muthistorema. Upeuthune gi aute te sugkhuse einai e uponomeutike stase tou ergou kai e epithetike stase tou suggraphea: me kuriarkho oplo te satira, o Skarimpas parodei ton uperrealismo kai, parallela, strephetai enantion tou paradosiakou muthistorematos, phtanontas se mia akraia graphe* me te sunthete aphegematike tou tekhnike kai ton anarkhiko tou logo, me te struphne tou suntaxe kai ten katakermatismene tou stixe anatrepei kathe kanona apodeiknuontas ten aneparkeia tes glossas na ekphrasei ten pragmatikoteta. Sugkhronos, upodelonei ston anagnoste te diadikasia suntheses tou muthistorematos tou, epomizontas ton me to baros tes apokodikopoieses tou."�
�"Khairesai pou khorizomaste pali, Estela; Gia mena o khorismos einai epoduno pragma. Gia mena e anamnese tou teleutaiou mas khorismou etan panta penthime kai odunere."
"Omos mou eikhes pei", apantese e Estela polu sobara, "'o Theos na s' eulogesei, o Theos na se sugkhoresei!' Ki aphou mporeses na mou to peis tote, de tha distaseis na mou to xanapeis tora, tora pou e dustukhia uperxe iskhurotere apo kathe alle didaskalia kai m' ekane na katalabo ti etan e kardia sou. Basanisteka kai upephera, omos -elpizo- oti egina kaluteros anthropos. Deixe ten idia katanoese kai kalosune apenanti mou opos palia kai pes mou pos eimaste philoi."
"Eimaste philoi", tes eipa, sekotheka ki eskupsa apo pano tes kathos sekonotan apo ton pagko.
"Kai tha sunekhisoume na eimaste philoi apo makria", eipe e Estela."�
�Ten toso phrikhte kai omos toso aple istoria pou arkhizo na grapho, oute perimeno oute zeto na ten pistepsete. Tha emoun, aletheia, trelos an perimena kati tetoio gia mia upothese, opou oi idies oi aistheseis mou arnountai ten marturia tous. Kai omos den eimai trelos -kai asphalos den oneireuomai. Alla aurio prokeitai na pethano kai tha thela na xalaphroso semera ten psukhe mou. Skopos mou einai na ektheso ston kosmo, aperitta kai dikhos kanena skholio, mia seira koinotata gegonota pou ekhoun skhese me to spiti mou. Auta ta gegonota, stis sunepeies tous, me tromokratesan, me basanisan, me katestrepsan. Ostoso, de tha epikheireso na tous doso mia exegese. Gia mena, parousiazan kati phrikhto -se pollous tha phanoun mallon allokota para tromera.Isos na brethei kapoio mualo, pou tha metabalei ta phantasmata mou se koinotopies- kapoio mualo pio eremo, pio logiko, kai polu ligotero euexapto ap to diko mou, pou sta peristatika pou tha existoro me deos, de tha dei tipota perissotero apo mia sunethismene kai polu phusike diadokhe aition kai aitiaton."�
�Kamia phora anoigei e porta siga siga kai mpaineis. Phoras aspro kataspro koustoumi kai lina papoutsia. Skubeis bazeis storgika ste khouphta mou 72 phragka kai pheugeis. Ekho meinei ste these pou m' apheses gia na me xanabreis. Omos prepei na khei perasei polus kairos giati ta nukhia mou makrunane ki oi philoi me phobountai.
Kathe mera mageireuo patates ekho khasei ten phantasia mou ki otan akouo <>tromazo. Nomizo pos prepei na katadoso kapoion.
Ekho phulaxei kati apokommata me kapoion pou legane pos eisai su. Ksero pos lene psemata oi ephemerides, giati grapsane pos sou rixane sta podia. Ksero pos pote de semadeuoune sta podia. Sto mualo einai o Stokhos, to nou sou e;"�
�Te khronia pou ekleina ta enenenta khronia mou thelesa na kano doro ston eauto mou mia nukhta trelou erota me mia ephebe parthena. Thumetheka te Roza Kamparkas, idioktetria enos paranomou oikou anokhes, e opoia sunethos eidopoiouse tous kalous pelates tes otan eikhe kapoia abgalte diathesime. Pote den eikha upokupsei s' ekeinon e se kapoion allo apo tous pollous aiskhrous peirasmous tes, alla aute den pisteue sten agnoteta ton arkhon mou. "Akoma kai e ethike einai upothese khronou", elege m' ena mokhthero khamogelo, "tha to deis".
Enas elikiomenos demosiographos apophasizei na giortasei ta enenekosta genethlia tou me megaleiode tropo, dinontas ston eauto tou ena doro pou tha ton kanei na aisthanetai oti einai akoma zontanos, mia neare parthena.
Otan te sunanta se enan oiko anokhes, anakaluptei oti brisketai sto kheilos tou thanatou, okhi apo gerateia alla apo erota. Auto to sugkinetiko neo muthistorema tou Gkampriel Gkarsia Markes, grammeno me to aparamillo stil enos apo tous megaluterous suggrapheis tou aiona mas, apotelei enan umno pros ton erota."�
�O Tom Ripleu ta ethele ola: ta khremata, ten epitukhia, ten kale zoe. Etan etoimos akoma kai na skotosei gia na ta apoktesei ola auta. Otan enas plousios Amerikanos tou zeta na pherei piso to gio tou, o opoios ekhei egkatastathei sten Italia, tha katastrosei ena diaboliko skhedio: na parei te these tou asotou uiou kai na zesei me ten tautoteta ekeinou mia zoe oneiremene...
Tipota aploustero gia ton Tom. Khare sto talento tou sten plastographia exapata tis arkhes. Kai se o,ti aphora to phono, ena aplo "dustukhema" tha tou epitrepsei na allaxei tautoteta, aphenontas sugkhronos na phanei e goeteia pou askouse to thuma ston thute tou...
Proto muthistorema tes seiras me eroa ton Ripleu, e opoia xekinese to 1955 kai oloklerotheke to 1990, "O talantoukhos kurios Ripleu" apotelei to pistopoietiko genneses enos apo tous pio apithanous kharakteres tes astunomikes logotekhnias, e diprosopia tou opoiou goeteuse kinematographistes opos o Rene Clement (Plein Soleil, 1960) kai o Anthony Minghella ("The Talented Mr. Ripley", 1999): prokeitai gia tainies pou prospathesan na sullaboun to anepaistheto. Enas goeteutikos estet alla kunikos sto epakro, philikos kai sumpathes alla me mia apekhthe alazoneia, o Tom apsepha kathe ethike, diekdikontas to dikaioma na skotonei, ste diarkeia tes makrokhrones karieras tou, e opoia xediplonetai se tessera akoma muthistoremata (ola stis Ekdoseis Agra).
"O Talantoukhos kurios Ripleu" timetheke to 1956 kai to 1957 me to Eidiko Brabeio tes Enoses Suggrapheon Ergon Musteriou, to galliko Grand Prix de Litterature Policiere, kathos kai to brabeio Entgkar Allan Poou tes Enoses Suggrapheon Ergon Musteriou.
To 1959 guristeke gallike tainia me ton titlo "Plein Soleil", se skenothesia Rene Kleman, me ton Alain Ntelon (agapemeno Ripleu tes Khaismith), te Mari Laphore kai ton Moris Rone. To 1999 paikhteke e tainia "O talantoukhos kurios Ripleu" se skenothesia Antonu Mingkella, me ton Mat Nteemon os Ripleu.
Apo to opisthophullo tou biblio"�
�H Khariet Banier exaphanisteke prin apo trianta exi khronia kata te diarkeia enos kalokairinou phestibal sto souediko theretro Khentempi. Para tis ereunes tes astunomias, de bretheke pote kanena ikhnos tes dekaexakhrones kopelas. To eskase; Epese thuma apagoges; E thuma dolophonias; Kaneis de gnorizei - e upothese ekleise, oloi xekhasan tis leptomereies.
Oloi, ektos apo to theio tes Khariet, ton Khenrik Banier, enan elikiomeno biomekhano, pou ekhei balei skopo tes zoes tou na lusei to musterio protou pethanei. Stous toikhous tou grapheiou tou uparkhoun saranta tria kornizarismena louloudia. Ta epta prota etan dora apo ten anipsia tou. Ta upoloipa ephtanan anonuma kathe khrono sta genethlia tou.
Etsi arkhizei to MILLENNIUM, mia peripeteia egklematos kai timorias, sexoualikes diastrophes kai oikonomikes apates, alla kai mia truphere erotike istoria anamesa se enan katatregmeno demosiographo kai ena anorektiko koritsi me tatouaz, aso stous upologistes."�
�Polles phones sunothountai s' auto to biblio tou Tomas Mpernkharnt, pou kuklophorese to 1978 kai pou enas kritikos polu eustokha onomase <>. Stis ekaton tesseris istories tou emphanizontai philosophoi, suggrapheis, ethopoioi, mentioum, modistres, upalleloi, mathetes, zographoi, demarkhoi kai proedroi kraton. Anamesa tous sunantoume kai gnosta onomata, opos tou Khamsoun, tes Mpakhman, tou proen basilia Oumbertou, tou Kounial kai allon. Merikes apo autes tis istories diabazontai san anekdota, alles san paraboles, san exophrenika peristatika e san paikhnidia tes moiras. O Mpernkharnt ergasteke sta niata tou gia arketa megalo khroniko diastema os dikastikos antapokrites, kai khresimopoiese s' auto to biblio semantiko tmema apo to uliko pou sugkentrose tote, pou anapheretai se phonous, lesteies, apates kai autoktonies. Otan o Mimos Ton Phonon kuklophorese sten Austria, upoblethekan polles menuseis enantion tou, apo suggeneis pou anagnorisan sto biblio dikous tous anthropous."�
�Olethrioi erotes, dipsa gia plouto, anthropoi se krise tautotetas, oikogeneiaka mustika, ekrektikes antipalotetes kai e dolophonike phantasia mias panourgas gunaikas sunthetoun to muthistorema tou Wilkie Collins, pou kathelose tous biktorianous anagnostes kai "apokathelose" ten biktoriane ethike, to thruliko "Armanteil".
O suggrapheas, zontas sto perithorio tes ethikes kai tou kathosprepismou, sugkatoikouse me ten nomime gunaika kai ten eromene tou ekhontas me ten teleutaia kai tria paidia!
E orge ton kritikon tes epokhes -thematophulakon opos panta kathe katestemenou- den ekampse tis poleseis tou Londrezikou periodikou Cornhill, opou demosieuontan se sunekheies to "Armanteil". O kathosprepismos kai ta thesphata kathe epokhes plathoun -san pelino aggeio- ton anthropo kai ton kosmo tou. Oi megaloi kallitekhnes me to ergo tous e kai me te zoe tous spane to aggeio. Mepos to anethiko ton biktorianon skiagraphei te sugkhrone ethike (erotes, khrema, panourgia, krise tautotetas);"�
�Paraboliko taxidi sto bathutero eauto mas e periplanese ste me anagnorismene istoria, me tagmata apo mustes pou sunteroun te khamene gnose. Kamia apantese den einai sigoure otan prokeitai gia ton Esse, giati e opoia apantese pou tha ton kathorize tha katestrephe ole te goeteia tou, ole te pheugalea atmosphaira anamesa sto pragmatiko kai to uperbatiko."�
�Aleksei Maksimovich Peshkov (better known as Maxim Gorky) (1868-1936), was a popular and influential Russian author, a founder of the socialist realism literary method and arguably the greatest Russian literary figure of the 20th century. He wrote stories, plays, memoirs and novels which touched the imagination of the Russian people, and was the first Russian author to write sympathetically of such characters as tramps and thieves, emphasizing their daily struggles against overwhelming odds. His works include: The Man Who Was Afraid (1901), Twenty-Six and One and Other Stories (1902), Children of the Sun (1905), Mother (1907) - one of his best-loved books, about a mother who secretly distributes forbidden literature, sowing truth and hope amongst the people of Russia - Creatures That Once Were Men (1918), Untimely Thoughts (1918) and Through Russia (1921)."�
�Den mporo" tou eipa. "Den mporo!"
"Sigoura;" me rotese autos.
"Nai. Polu tha ethela na mporousa na statho mprosta tes kai na tes po ti niotho... Ksero, omos, oti den mporo."
O Khontros kathise san ton Bouda pano s' ekeines tis phrikhtes mple poluthrones tou grapheiou tou. Khamogelase, me koitaxe sta matia kai, khamelonontas te phone opos ekane kathe phora pou ethele na ton akousoun prosektika, mou eipe:
"Na sou po mia istoria..."
Kai khoris na perimenei na sumphoneso, o Khorkhe arkhise na aphegeitai.
O Ntemian einai enas anesukhos nearos phoitetes pou prospathei na anakalupsei ton eauto tou. Oi anazeteseis tou ton kateuthunoun ston "Khontro", enan polu idiorruthmo psukhanalute pou ton boetha na antimetopisei te zoe kai na brei apanteseis sta erotemata tou me enan tropo polu prototupo: se kathe sunantese, tou diegeitai apo mia istoria, klasike e monterna, "anatolitike" e "dutikotrope", pou pegazei apo te laike prophorike paradose e apeutheias apo te phantasia tou "Khontrou". Oi istories arkhizoun na leitourgoun os paraboles, kai o Ntemian katasigazei tis agonies kai tis anasphaleies tou, orimazontas mallon, para briskontas "etoimes luseis" kai "suntages eutukhias"... Oi skheseis metaxu therapeute kai therapeuomenou den einai -oute autes- sumbatikes kai anamenomenes. Kabgades, diaphonies, sumpatheia, antipatheia, misos kai agape aphenontai eleuthera na ekphrastoun, demiourgontas me auton ton tropo duo monadikous logotekhnikous eroes me sarka kai osta, prosphileis kai oikeious ston anagnoste. Kamia skhese edo me to stereotupo tou psukhanalutikou ntibaniou kai tou orizontiomenou paskhontos. O dialogos kai e antallage empeirion kai apopseon, dianthismenos me exairetikes aphegeseis istorion, topothetoun to "Na sou po mia istoria" sten kategoria ton logotekhnikon biblion, askhetos ean, pagkosmios, topotheteitai kato apo ten etiketta: "Biblia autognosias kai autoboetheias"."�
