Meta ten xaphnike epithese ton stratioton Ork, e Suntrophia tou Dakhtulidiou dialuetai. Kaneis pleon den xerei ti tha ginei me ten apostole tous. Tha katapherei o Phronto, o Dakhtulidokoubaletes, mazi me ton pisto tou uperete ton Sam na phtasoun ste khora tou ekhthrou kai na katastrepsoun to paniskhuro Dakhtulidi; Kai tha brethoun xana arage oloi mazi; Oi dunameis tou kakou tous parakolouthoun se kathe tous bema. Idiaitera o tromeros magos Sarouman.."�
�E Khariet kai o Nteibint Lobat epithumoun ta idia pragmata: aphosiose, agape, oikogeneiake zoe kai, pano ap' ola, ena diko tous spiti. Peismatika apokommenoi apo te moda tes dekaetias tou '60, apophasizoun na pantreutoun kai na baloun ta themelia tou paradeisou tous s' ena megalo biktoriano spiti. Sten arkhe ola einai eidulliaka. Ta paidia gemizoun te zoe tous kai oi suggeneis xanantamonoun sto trapezi ton Khristougennon kai tou Paskha gia na apolausoun te thalpore tou spitiou ton Lobat. Sten pempte egkumosune, ostoso, kati den paei kala. To embruo arkhizei apo polu noris na striphogurizei biaia sten koilia tes Khariet. Ustera apo ena duskolo toketo, to neogenneto anaptussetai takhutera apo ta sunethismena mora. Epithetiko kai astorgo, gnorizei gregora ten enstiktode antipatheia ton adelphion tou. E allokote uparxe tou katastrephei ten eutukhismene oikogeneiake zoe tous."�	
�	Ta <>tou Kosta Moursela einai ena muthistorema pou prokalei, erethizei, exorgizei, erotiko, aisthesiako, khudaio, apotropaio, dosmeno apla, me khioumor, eironeia kai kaustike diathese. Sugkhronoi Amlet, sugkhronoi Zormpades, agiopoiemena koproskula, pornes, mporntela, geitonies, paragkes, numphomaneis, aunanes, papatzedes, mikroastoi, proen proletarioi, proen ideologoi kai nun <>karieristes, kalpedes, xephtiles, anthropoi pou eroteuontai prosopa mes' apo kathrephtes kai okhi ta idia ta prosopa, mia toikhographia epokhes kai anthropon, diegemena asthmatika, paraphora, oma m' enan phrenere realismo pou ta kanei ola na diastellontai, na megethunontai kai na ginontai okeanos, thalassa, khroma, mousike, almura, erotas. E istoria enos thesei dianooumenou pou ek ton usteron diapistonei pos <>kai enos allou -phusei dianooumenou- pou apodeiknuei me te zoe tou, ten praxe pos ola tha mporouse na eikhan sumbei kai allios kai pos krima gia to <>mas mia kai kaneis mas den glitonei apo ten telike krise, apo ton teliko kai moiraio apologismo. Akoma, e istoria mias gunaikas pou oso buthizetai stous sumbibasmous tes, oso adeiazei, toso plesiazei sten pleroteta, oso apomakrunetai apo ton erota, toso ton anakaluptei. (APO TEN PAROUSIASE STO OPISThOPhULLO TOU BIBLIOU)"�
�E Lismpet Salanter, idiophuia stous upologistes, de distazei mprosta se tipota prokeimenou na petukhei to stokho tes. Den xekhna kai de sugkhorei, kai otan sunanta diaphthora kai kakopoiese, idios apenanti se gunaikes, einai aneleete.
Kerussontas polemo s' autous pou kinoun ta nemata tes biomekhanias tou emporiou sarkos khresimopoiei tis ikanotetes tes os khaker gia na boethesei sten ereuna pou ekhei xekinesei o Mikael Mploumkbist, ekdotes tou periodikou Millennium. Empleketai, omos, athela tes se mia diple dolophonia, eno e astunomia ten kunega kai gia enan trito phono. Ola ta stoikheia ten enokhopoioun kai ta daktulika tes apotupomata ekhoun brethei sto oplo tou egklematos. Kathos oles oi dunameis ste Souedia alla kai apophasismenoi egklematies einai sta ikhne tes, e Lismpet den ekhei alle epiloge: prepei na anakalupsei kai na xeskepasei ten aletheia protou einai arga gia ten idia tes te zoe.
To deutero biblio tes trilogias Millennium pou ekhei sarosei ta brabeia kai ekhei enthousiasei kritikous kai anagnostes se olo ton kosmo. Ena mnemeiodes politikooikonomiko alla kai erotiko thriler pou prokalese aisthese se ole ten Europe!"	��Q�@"	=
